  <data name="Sobre_Titulo" xml:space="preserve"><value>About HomePlanner</value></data>
  <data name="Sobre_P1" xml:space="preserve"><value>HomePlanner was born from a real need: organizing a family's routine — what to cook, what to buy and what everyone needs to do — without jumping between several confusing apps.</value></data>
  <data name="Sobre_P2" xml:space="preserve"><value>We believe planning the week should be calm and even enjoyable. That's why we built a beautiful, simple, trilingual tool designed for real families.</value></data>
  <data name="Sobre_MissaoTitulo" xml:space="preserve"><value>Our mission</value></data>
  <data name="Sobre_MissaoTexto" xml:space="preserve"><value>Give families back time and peace of mind, one menu at a time.</value></data>

